# Copy to .context/gate1.env — .context/ is in .git/info/exclude (not .gitignore)
# so the signing key survives branch switches in this clone.
# To change a frozen test: copy wiki/gate1/unfreeze-request.template.md to a
# dated request, fill its evidence and authorization, edit the oracle, then run
# node scripts/approve-gate1.js. The first run prints the exact digest needed
# for --confirm-digest-delta; no frozen bytes change until that confirmation.
RIG_GATE1_SIGNING_KEY= path-to-key
